<h1>Standardized comparison</h1>
<p>{{ question_count }} identical coordinate questions across {{ family_count }} families. Temperature 0.7,
a 262,144-token total budget, top-p 1.0 and disabled top-k filtering for adjustable models.</p>
<p class="note">Astra and Opus reject custom sampling controls. Their <code>standardized-*</code> variants
use the same context-budget rule with fixed provider sampling; they are exceptions to temperature and sampler
matching. Matching request controls does not make tokenizers, reasoning computation or numerical inference identical.</p>
<p class="meta">Generated {{ generated_at }} · scientific commit <a href="https://github.com/Open-Athena/pdbthink/commit/{{ scientific_commit }}">{{ scientific_short_commit }}</a>
· prompt {{ prompt_version }} · scorer {{ scoring_version }}</p>
